; TEST-ARGS: -single-vscale:1
; CHECK: <vscale:1 x 2 x i4>
; ERROR: Target is more poisonous than source for i4 %r

; Same transformation as scalablevector2.opt, which runs it at vscale 2.
; The number of lanes follows vscale, so at vscale 1 this type has only two
; lanes, lane 3 is out of range, and the target is poison.

Name: insert and extract at lane 3

%t = insertelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %vec, i4 %x, i64 0
%r = extractelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %t, i64 0
=>
%u = insertelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %vec, i4 %x, i64 3
%r = extractelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %u, i64 3
